    {
      "id": "claim_9a1b062148d647c4a537af452872802d",
      "statement": "`server.handler.instrument` contains the active business handler: `InstrumentPostHandler` validates and transforms the instrument body, performs the signed e-wallet POST, and interprets upstream HTTP 201 as success while staging `response_code`, `response_desc`, and `response_data` for `ResponseHandler`.",
